{{Quote|Our Clone Intelligence units have discovered the location of General Grievous. He's hiding out in the Utapau system.|Chancellor Palpatine, to Anakin Skywalker|<ref name="III">{{Film|III}}</ref>}}
The '''Utapau system''' was a [[Star system|solar system]] located within the [[Tarabba sector]] which contained the [[planet]] of [[Utapau]] and its multiple [[moon]]s.<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> Utapau was located deep within the system.<ref name="Epic Clashes">{{Topps|set=2023 Topps Star Wars|subset=Epic Clashes|cardname=Obi-Wan Kenobi / General Grievous|link=https://www.tcdb.com/ViewCard.cfm/sid/379262/cid/22199676}}</ref>

